	'contact_s1_h' => 'Address and hours',
	'contact_s1_p1' => 'Kikan College, 22 Foundry Lane, Wrenfield. The building is the former foundry workshop, with two bench halls on the ground floor. The office is open Monday to Friday, 08:00–16:30. Bench halls are open Monday to Thursday, 07:45–15:30, and on Friday, 08:30–15:30. Taster Saturday, the first Saturday of every month except August, runs 09:00–15:00.',
	'contact_s1_p2' => 'The evening refresher is on Tuesdays, 18:00–21:00. Phone +00 44 555 0193. Email hello@kikan-college.example. A message to the office should say whether you are a prospective apprentice, an employer, a family member, or writing for another reason, so the reply goes to the right person.',
	'contact_s2_h' => 'Getting here',
	'contact_s2_p1' => 'Bus 14 from Wrenfield station takes 8 minutes to Foundry Lane. There are bike racks by the building. Parking is in the yard. The workshop is a brick building; at dusk the roller door is often half open and the hall light shows through. There is no sign you need to hunt for beyond the address.',
	'contact_s2_p2' => 'If you are coming for a Tuesday visit, arrive for 16:00, after the bench day ends at 15:30. If you are coming for a taster Saturday, the welcome is at 09:00. The office can confirm the bus stop if you call +00 44 555 0193 during Monday to Friday, 08:00–16:30.',
	'contact_s3_h' => 'Access',
	'contact_s3_p1' => 'Both bench halls are on the ground floor and the building is step-free. Say so on the form if you have access needs, whether you are coming for a taster Saturday, a Tuesday visit, or a bench morning. The Saturday booking asks for access needs in its own field. The application does not, so put them in the note about why you want the trade, or in the email if you write instead.',
	'contact_s3_p2' => 'Rosa Lindqvist\'s hall and Emeka Obi\'s hall are reached on the same level. Visitors do not need to climb to a teaching room. The theory room used on Friday is in the same workshop.',
