	'fees_h' => 'Fees',
	'fees_lede' => 'Every fee is in euros, and the figures on this page are the same ones on the home page and in the application summary. A EUR 300 deposit holds a place and counts towards Year 1.',
	'fees_rail' => 'FEES · EUR',
	'fees_s1_h' => 'The seven fees',
	'fees_s1_p1' => 'Year 1, the bench year, is EUR 4,800. It covers 38 weeks, four bench days and one theory day, from September to July. Year 2, the placement year, is EUR 2,400. It covers four days placed with a firm, one college day, and three site visits, September to July. The starter tool kit is EUR 640 in Year 1, week 1: a cutter, a bender, grips, a torch, and a case, yours to keep.',
	'fees_s1_p2' => 'The workwear and safety pack is EUR 180 in that same week: two overalls, boots, gloves, and glasses. Assessment and the logbook are EUR 220 per year, for the bench assessments and the signed logbook. The evening refresher is EUR 390, six Tuesday evenings for people already in the trade, rolling. Taster Saturday is free: one Saturday at the bench, lunch included, monthly.',
	'fees_s2_h' => 'Instalments and the deposit',
	'fees_s2_p1' => 'Year fees can be paid in ten monthly instalments at no extra cost. A EUR 300 deposit holds a place and counts towards Year 1. Placement firms pay apprentices a training wage in Year 2; the amount is agreed with each firm. The deposit is taken up when you accept the offer. The offer letter comes within 10 working days of the bench morning. The ten instalments apply to the year fees, EUR 4,800 for Year 1 and EUR 2,400 for Year 2.',
	'fees_s2_p2' => 'There is no extra cost for using those ten months. The kit at EUR 640, the workwear pack at EUR 180, the assessment fee at EUR 220 per year, and the evening refresher at EUR 390 stay as their own lines. Taster Saturday stays free. The office confirms the amounts in the offer letter, not as a separate price list.',
	'fees_s3_h' => 'Tool kit, workwear, and the refresher',
	'fees_s3_p1' => 'The starter tool kit is issued in Year 1, week 1, and it is yours to keep. The pieces are a cutter, a bender, grips, a torch, and a case, at EUR 640. The workwear and safety pack is issued the same week: two overalls, boots, gloves, and glasses, at EUR 180. Those are the tools and clothes of a bench day after week 1. Safety glasses are worn when cutting or soldering.',
	'fees_s3_p2' => 'The evening refresher is a separate course for people already in the trade: six Tuesday evenings, 18:00–21:00, at EUR 390, rolling through the year. It is not part of the two-year apprenticeship and it does not take one of the 24 September places. Taster Saturday remains the free way to see the bench before any fee is discussed. Lunch on that Saturday is included.',
	'fees_s4_h' => 'If we cancel, or if you leave',
	'fees_s4_p1' => 'The deposit is returned if we cancel the place. If you leave before November, the course fee is charged pro rata for the time you have been here, and the rest of that year fee is returned. The starter tool kit at EUR 640 and the workwear and safety pack at EUR 180 are issued in week 1 and are yours to keep, so those lines are not part of the pro rata return.',
	'fees_s4_p2' => 'Assessment and the logbook, EUR 220 per year, follows the year you are in. The evening refresher, EUR 390, is a separate booking of six Tuesday evenings and is not covered by this leave rule. Write to hello@kikan-college.example or call +00 44 555 0193, Monday to Friday, 08:00–16:30, and the office will set the figures in writing.',
	'fees_s5_h' => 'Next steps',
	'fees_s5_p1' => 'A EUR 300 deposit holds a place only after an offer letter, and that letter follows the 90-minute bench morning within 10 working days. Applications for September close on 30 April. Year 1 is EUR 4,800 and Year 2 is EUR 2,400, each payable in ten monthly instalments at no extra cost.',
	'fees_s5_p2' => 'Come to a taster Saturday before you decide: the first Saturday of every month, 09:00–15:00, not in August, and it is free. The office is at 22 Foundry Lane, Wrenfield. Both halls are on the ground floor and are step-free. Questions about instalments go to hello@kikan-college.example during Monday to Friday, 08:00–16:30.',
