	'ns_stories_t' => 'Apprentice stories',
	'open-days_h' => 'Open days',
	'open-days_lede' => 'Taster Saturday is the first Saturday of every month, 09:00–15:00, and it does not run in August. The morning needs no booking, boots and glasses are provided, and lunch is included.',
	'open-days_rail' => 'TASTER SATURDAY · MONTHLY',
	'open-days_s1_h' => 'The Saturday timetable',
	'open-days_s1_p1' => 'The day is short and the order does not change. At 09:00 there is a welcome in the hall. At 09:30 you are at the bench, cutting and looking at a joint with an instructor. At 12:00 lunch is served, and it is included. At 13:00 the group moves to the boiler rig for a look at a pressure test and the way a fault is talked through.',
	'open-days_s1_p2' => 'At 14:30 there is time for questions. At 15:00 the day closes. The whole visit is free. No booking is needed for the morning. Boots and glasses are provided. The halls are the same ones used in term: Bench Hall A for pipework and Bench Hall B for the rig, both step-free on the ground floor at 22 Foundry Lane, Wrenfield.',
	'open-days_s2_h' => 'Tuesday visits at 16:00',
	'open-days_s2_p1' => 'If a Saturday is hard to reach, come on a Tuesday at 16:00. The bench day finishes at 15:30, so the visit starts when the bays have been swept and the logbooks signed. You see the halls after a real teaching day, not during one. It is a shorter look than the Saturday, and it is the other door into an application.',
	'open-days_s2_p2' => 'The office can tell you which Tuesday is quiet if you call +00 44 555 0193 during Monday to Friday, 08:00–16:30. The evening refresher, also on Tuesdays, is a different thing: 18:00–21:00, six evenings, EUR 390, for people already in the trade. A 16:00 visit is not that class.',
	'open-days_s3_h' => 'Dates and what to expect',
	'open-days_s3_p1' => 'Taster Saturday falls on the first Saturday of every month, and it does not run in August. The next one is always that first Saturday, 09:00–15:00. You do not need to book the morning. If you are bringing a guest, or if you need the office to know about access before you arrive, write to hello@kikan-college.example and name the Saturday.',
	'open-days_s3_p2' => 'Both halls are on the ground floor and are step-free. Wear clothes you can stand in for a day. Boots and glasses are here if you do not have them. Lunch is included. The day is free. It is not a lesson you are marked on, and nobody expects the piece of pipe you cut to be good.',
	'open-days_s4_h' => 'Booking a Saturday',
	'open-days_s4_p1' => 'No booking is needed for the morning. If you want a named place, or you are bringing one guest, email hello@kikan-college.example with the Saturday you mean and whether the guest is coming. Tell us your name and a phone number if you have one. Say if you have access needs so the step-free route is the one we walk you in on.',
	'open-days_s4_p2' => 'We reply within five working days. The form on this page asks for a date, a guest if any, and your consent that Kikan College may contact you about the booking. The submit line is to book the Saturday. The office is open Monday to Friday, 08:00–16:30, on +00 44 555 0193.',
	'open-days_strip' => 'SATURDAY',
	'page-contact_h' => 'Contact',
	'page-contact_n' => '01',
	'page-contact_sub' => 'College office Mon–Fri 08:00–16:30, 22 Foundry Lane, Wrenfield. Phone +00 44 555 0193.',
	'page-newsletter_h' => 'College letter',
	'page-newsletter_n' => '01',
	'page-newsletter_sub' => 'One short email a month: taster dates, a bench tip and a placement note.',
	'pc1_l' => 'days a week with the firm',
	'pc1_n' => '4',
	'pc2_l' => 'named engineer for the whole year',
